Set Filter Persistent Selection, Calculated Columns Improvements, High-Contrast/Forced Color Mode Support, Accessibility Improvements, Performance Improvements

## What's New

AG Grid {% migrationVersion() %} adds important new features - [Set Filter Persistent Selection](./filter-set-data-updates/#preserving-previous-values), [Calculated Columns Improvements](./calculated-columns/), High-Contrast/Forced Color Mode Support, [Accessibility Improvements](./accessibility/), Performance Improvements.
These improvements involve no breaking changes as listed below.

